## ⚡ 2. Diagrama do Pipeline HTTP (Middlewares de Telemetria e Segurança)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Dashboard Client (Angular)
    participant PerfMid as PerformanceMetricsMiddleware
    participant JwtMid as JwtRequestAnalyzerMiddleware
    participant Ctrl as MaterialsController
    participant App as MaterialAppService
    participant Repo as InMemoryMaterialRepository

    Client->>PerfMid: Requisição HTTP (GET /api/materials)
    Note over PerfMid: 1. Inicia Stopwatch<br/>2. Captura GC.GetTotalMemory inicial

    PerfMid->>JwtMid: Encaminha para JwtRequestAnalyzer
    Note over JwtMid: Rota é pública (/ ou login)?<br/>NÃO: Inspeciona Authorization: Bearer

    alt Token Ausente ou Inválido
        JwtMid-->>Client: Responde 401 Unauthorized (JSON padronizado)
    else Token JWT Válido
        Note over JwtMid: 1. Valida Assinatura HMAC-SHA256<br/>2. Preenche HttpContext.User
        JwtMid->>Ctrl: Encaminha para Controller
        Ctrl->>App: GetAllAsync()
        App->>Repo: GetAllAsync()
        Repo-->>App: Retorna Material[] da memória
        App-->>Ctrl: Retorna MaterialDto[] (Array estruturado)
        Ctrl-->>JwtMid: 200 OK com Payload em Array
        JwtMid-->>PerfMid: Resposta do Pipeline
        Note over PerfMid: 1. Finaliza Stopwatch<br/>2. Calcula delta de memória<br/>3. Injeta headers X-Response-Time-Ms e X-Memory-Allocated-Bytes
        PerfMid-->>Client: 200 OK com Headers de Diagnóstico + Array JSON
    end
```

